== District 8 ==
{{see also|Tennessee's 8th congressional district}}
The 8th district is located in western Tennessee, including the cities of [[Jackson, TN|Jackson]] and [[Union City, TN|Union City]], and the Memphis suburbs, such as [[Bartlett, TN|Bartlett]] and [[Germantown, TN|Germantown]]. This district has a PVI of R+19.  The incumbent is Republican [[David Kustoff]], who has represented the district since 2017.  Kustoff was elected with 69% of the vote in 2016.

